# Base URL of the 2048-arena leaderboard backend (see ../server).
#
# Two common setups:
#
# 1) Separate origins (local dev, or frontend/backend on different hosts):
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
#
# 2) Same origin, reverse-proxied behind one domain (recommended for a
#    single-server production deployment — see ../deploy/nginx.conf.example).
#    Leave the value empty so requests go to a relative "/api/..." path:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=
